# DesktopSplitter product version - THE SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH.
#
# Format: MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH
#
#   PATCH  Bumped AUTOMATICALLY by build.ps1 on every successful build
#          (0.5.1 -> 0.5.2 -> 0.5.3 ...). Never edit it by hand.
#   MINOR  Bump BY HAND for new functionality or a notable change.
#   MAJOR  Bump BY HAND for a large update or a breaking change.
#
# To change MAJOR/MINOR, do NOT edit the number below directly - run:
#
#     .\build.ps1 -SetVersion 0.6.0
#
# so every generated artefact is regenerated from it in the same step.
# Use  .\build.ps1 -NoVersionBump  to iterate without consuming a version.
#
# Everything below this comment block is parsed as the version: the last
# non-empty, non-comment line wins.
0.5.6
